# WASM Size History

This document tracks the compiled WASM size of each contract release build.
Sizes are recorded whenever they change. CI enforces the per-contract budget
below and fails the release build if any contract exceeds its budget.

## Size Budgets

| Contract | Budget (bytes) |
| --- | --- |
| governance | 262144 |
| token | 196608 |

Budgets are enforced by the CI size guard. Update the budget only with a
justified reason; the guard exists to prevent accidental bloat.

